  "body": "Per https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1223885 it seems that in the majority of implementations cookies cross the about:blank boundary too, just like HTTPS state, etc.\n\nIt seems this copying is not currently happening when creating a new browsing context though: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context. Hmm.\n",
